From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FPSensor <gkartyt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:18:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] usb: gadget: f_fs: Import AIO support from the hammerhead
 kernel

The Android 16 adbd only speaks to FunctionFS through io_submit() (the
legacy synchronous path was removed), which needs aio_read/aio_write on
the endpoint files (Linux 3.15). Without them the device showed up as
'offline'. Take f_fs.c from acroreiser's lineage-23.2 hammerhead 3.4
kernel, which carries that backport, and stub the device callbacks its
android.c provides.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011zBcPW2nw54WW3Y9cSJSXw
